WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.744
Ben pulled the rest of his body out of the tree.

2
00:00:06.745 --> 00:00:10.578
He leaned over the storm drain and peered in.

3
00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:14.232
Water rushed by below.

4
00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:18.046
He groaned. "Winnie's gift is gone.

5
00:00:18.047 --> 00:00:19.910
What am I going to do now?"

6
00:00:19.911 --> 00:00:23.897
Ben felt the kitten swat at his ankle.

7
00:00:23.898 --> 00:00:25.324
He turned around.

8
00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:30.804
"Winnie's going to hate me," he grumbled.

9
00:00:30.805 --> 00:00:33.541
"And it's all your fault."

10
00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:35.763
It was getting late.

11
00:00:35.764 --> 00:00:40.653
"Winnie and Gaby will be back at Winnie's house soon," Ben thought.

12
00:00:40.654 --> 00:00:43.630
"I need to get over there."

13
00:00:43.631 --> 00:00:46.993
Ben floated to Winnie's house.

14
00:00:46.994 --> 00:00:58.076
He felt so miserable, he hardly noticed the kitten following him, still swatting at his feet.

15
00:00:58.077 --> 00:01:01.610
"Ben's here!" Mog shouted as Ben entered.

16
00:01:01.611 --> 00:01:07.171
The kitten followed him in.

17
00:01:07.172 --> 00:01:09.570
"Hey," Ben mumbled.

18
00:01:09.571 --> 00:01:15.544
"It's Monster Academy's most famous chef!" a two-headed monster said.

19
00:01:15.545 --> 00:01:18.778
"Check it out!" A ghoul held up a pan.

20
00:01:18.779 --> 00:01:21.363
"It's your mac and cheese, Ben!"

21
00:01:21.364 --> 00:01:23.980
A witch ran over.

22
00:01:23.981 --> 00:01:28.308
"We grabbed it during the hot sauce explosion.

23
00:01:28.309 --> 00:01:32.088
We figured we could eat it during the party."

24
00:01:32.089 --> 00:01:34.138
"Oh, wow," Ben said.

25
00:01:34.139 --> 00:01:36.407
That made him feel a little better.

26
00:01:36.408 --> 00:01:39.853
Deb waved to him. "Can you help me, Ben?"

27
00:01:39.854 --> 00:01:43.026
She was stringing spiderwebs across the walls.

28
00:01:43.027 --> 00:01:48.668
The long, thin strands of silk spelled out "Happy Birthday, Winnie!"

29
00:01:48.669 --> 00:01:52.247
"Sure. What do I do?" Ben asked.

30
00:01:52.248 --> 00:01:53.999
"I finished the words.

31
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.743
Now I want to make a design around them. Here, hold this."

32
00:01:58.744 --> 00:02:05.604
Deb handed Ben the ball of spider silk that she was using to make the design.

33
00:02:05.605 --> 00:02:10.518
Meow! The kitten leaped up and swatted the ball out of Ben's hand.

34
00:02:10.519 --> 00:02:12.326
"Ack!" Ben cried.

35
00:02:12.327 --> 00:02:17.061
The kitten ran after the ball, batting it around.

36
00:02:17.062 --> 00:02:22.679
As the ball rolled away from the web, the message was ripped away too.

37
00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:26.741
Soon all of Deb's hard work trailed after the kitten.

38
00:02:26.742 --> 00:02:28.726
Ben shot after the kitten.

39
00:02:28.727 --> 00:02:33.662
"Come back here! You can't play with that!"

40
00:02:33.663 --> 00:02:38.712
Meow! The kitten ran under a table and between a werewolf's ankles.

41
00:02:38.713 --> 00:02:41.006
The werewolf was holding a punch bowl.

42
00:02:41.007 --> 00:02:46.779
"Whoa!" The werewolf lost his balance, and the punch bowl flew out of his hands.

43
00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:50.441
It landed with a splash on an octopus monster.

44
00:02:50.442 --> 00:02:54.130
"There goes the newt punch," a goblin said.

45
00:02:54.131 --> 00:02:58.163
"I spent a lot of time making that!" a witch said.

46
00:02:58.164 --> 00:03:00.332
"It's Winnie's favorite!"

47
00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:04.511
Ben was still chasing the kitten.

48
00:03:04.512 --> 00:03:10.026
It had leaped onto a table and was now batting around a bug cake.

49
00:03:10.027 --> 00:03:14.155
"Whose kitten is this?" a three-eyed monster yelled.

50
00:03:14.156 --> 00:03:18.576
She snatched the bug cake away from the kitten and put it back on its plate.

51
00:03:18.577 --> 00:03:21.967
Meow! The kitten stepped onto the plate.

52
00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:25.050
"Shoo!" the three-eyed monster cried.

53
00:03:25.051 --> 00:03:28.241
Startled, the kitten scrambled down the table.

54
00:03:28.242 --> 00:03:31.910
Cups, bowls, and snacks flew everywhere.

55
00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:35.009
Ben felt hot all over.

56
00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:38.343
First he'd lost Winnie's present.

57
00:03:38.344 --> 00:03:41.496
Now he was ruining her party.

58
00:03:41.497 --> 00:03:46.788
Finally the kitten leaped onto a sofa and started cleaning herself.

59
00:03:46.789 --> 00:03:52.040
Waldo looked at the mess.

60
00:03:52.041 --> 00:03:54.290
"Well, I guess we should clean this up.

61
00:03:54.291 --> 00:03:55.934
Gaby and Winnie will be here—"

62
00:03:55.935 --> 00:04:00.556
"Right now!" Mog cried, peeking out the window.

63
00:04:00.557 --> 00:04:04.038
"Gaby and Winnie are walking up the driveway!"

64
00:04:04.039 --> 00:04:06.683
"There's no time to clean up," Waldo said.

65
00:04:06.684 --> 00:04:08.641
"Places, everyone!"

66
00:04:08.642 --> 00:04:12.154
All the monsters scurried into hiding places.

67
00:04:12.155 --> 00:04:16.430
Ben shot an annoyed look at the kitten and ducked behind a chair.

68
00:04:16.431 --> 00:04:20.504
"Winnie's going to be so surprised," someone whispered.

69
00:04:20.505 --> 00:04:23.471
"Shh!" someone else whispered.

70
00:04:23.472 --> 00:04:28.134
Ben heard several giggles as everyone waited for the door to open.

71
00:04:28.135 --> 00:04:30.953
Meow! The kitten went to Ben.

72
00:04:30.954 --> 00:04:35.459
"Go away!" Ben whispered. "Leave me alone!"

73
00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:38.276
"Shh!" Waldo hissed.

74
00:04:38.277 --> 00:04:42.116
Frowning, Ben scooped up the kitten and held it tightly.

75
00:04:42.117 --> 00:04:47.761
A second later the front door opened, and Winnie and Gaby walked in.

76
00:04:47.762 --> 00:04:53.375
Everyone jumped out. "Surprise!"

77
00:04:53.376 --> 00:04:55.736
Winnie's eyes went wide.

78
00:04:55.737 --> 00:04:59.826
She looked at Gaby, who was grinning down at her.

79
00:04:59.827 --> 00:05:03.633
"I'm shocked!" Winnie said, smiling widely.

80
00:05:03.634 --> 00:05:06.891
"I had no idea you guys were doing this!"

81
00:05:06.892 --> 00:05:09.257
Then she looked around at the mess.

82
00:05:09.258 --> 00:05:11.670
"What happened in here?"

83
00:05:11.671 --> 00:05:16.289
Ben floated over to her.

84
00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:20.241
"Hey, Winnie. This is actually my fault. You see, I—"

85
00:05:20.242 --> 00:05:25.225
Meow! The kitten leaped from Ben's hands and into Winnie's arms.

86
00:05:25.226 --> 00:05:29.686
Winnie gasped. "Is this for me?"

87
00:05:29.687 --> 00:05:32.896
Ben didn't know what to say. "Uh . . ."

88
00:05:32.897 --> 00:05:36.971
"A black kitten! It's so cute!"

89
00:05:36.972 --> 00:05:39.226
She snuggled the kitten.

90
00:05:39.227 --> 00:05:44.593
"Let's get this party started!" Mog shouted.

91
00:05:44.594 --> 00:05:50.343
He turned on some monster music and pushed the furniture to the edges of the room.

92
00:05:50.344 --> 00:05:53.678
A few monsters cleaned up the mess.

93
00:05:53.678 --> 00:05:59.468
And soon everyone was dancing and eating.

94
00:05:59.469 --> 00:06:01.360
Winnie turned toward Ben.

95
00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:03.960
"What a perfect birthday gift.

96
00:06:03.961 --> 00:06:07.368
How did you know I wanted a black kitten?"

97
00:06:07.369 --> 00:06:12.387
Ben shrugged, glancing down at his shoes. "Actually—"

98
00:06:12.388 --> 00:06:19.305
Just then a popular song, "Midnight Magic," started blaring through the speakers.

99
00:06:19.306 --> 00:06:28.976
"Let's dance!" Winnie cried, rushing toward the middle of the living room.

100
00:06:28.977 --> 00:06:40.753
Ben hurried after her. "Sounds good to me!"

